<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>These are the days of rejoicing:</l><l>Lift up your praise to our King!</l><l>And these are the days of pressing forward:</l><l>As brothers and sisters we sing.</l><l>And these are the days of Your kingdom:</l><l>We stand and declare to the world</l><l>That we are forever one in spirit</l><l>Declaring the name of the Lord!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
